        }
      ],
      "returnType": "LANDSCAPE_EDIT_LAYERS_BATCHED_MERGE_EXPERIMENTAL void",
      "docs": "Runs the given function for each all valid target layer in the bit indices in parameters, with the possibility of early exit\nMost easily used with a lambda as follows:\nForEachTargetLayer([](int32 InTargetLayerIndex, FName InTargetLayerName) -> bool\n{\nreturn continueLoop ? true : false;\n});"
